  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building skills for market-based livelihoods for youth in Assosa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project envisions to contribute to the enhancement of market-based livelihoods for refugee and host community youth in Assosa through access to relevant skills. It entails training youth on market-oriented technical and entrepreneurial skills in NRC&apos;s four existing training centres in the camps, government Technical and Vocational Education and Training (TVET) colleges and in the Business Processing Outsourcing (BPO) centre that will be established.</narrative>
  </description>
